studio-motion-effects adapts design ideas from two MIT-licensed projects:
the 16 interaction recipes and the move, hold and return clock from Charlie
Hills' motion skills, and the one-shape morph, cursor and spring vocabulary
from Bart's motion-broll. The text and code here are rewritten for the
PocketPaw editor; no upstream engine, font or icon file is shipped.

